---
name: toggle
type: registry:ui
title: Toggle
description: A two-state button that can be either on or off.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/toggle/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/toggle/index.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/toggle/toggle.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/toggle/toggle.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/toggle/toggle.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/toggle/toggle.variants.ts"
---

Use toggle for on/off controls like formatting buttons. Bind `pressed`; choose `variant` (`default` | `outline`)
and `size` (`sm` | `default` | `lg`).

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import BookmarkIcon from '@lucide/svelte/icons/bookmark';
	import { Toggle } from '~/components/toggle';
</script>

<Toggle
	aria-label="Toggle bookmark"
	size="sm"
	variant="outline"
	class="data-[state=on]:bg-transparent data-[state=on]:*:[svg]:fill-blue-500 data-[state=on]:*:[svg]:stroke-blue-500"
>
	<BookmarkIcon />
	Bookmark
</Toggle>
```
